      "claim": "A parent reports that strangers can message or voice chat with your child in Minecraft.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Online multiplayer games allow kids to chat with friends *and* strangers. And while most of these players may be harmless, some have far more dangerous intentions."
