      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Gaming platforms have created their own economies using virtual currencies like V-Bucks (Fortnite), Robux (Roblox), and Minecoins (Minecraft). While these might seem like play money to kids, they have actual cash value and attract sophisticated criminals."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D522]",
