      "claim": "A parent reports that the age gate does not reliably block younger children from accessing the game or its social features.",
      "stance": "neutral",
      "quote": "Video games have long been popular with teenagers, but gaming has become an increasingly dominant part of childhood, with younger kids now gaming more than ever."
